UI event, and extracts context headers (signed tokens, schema version).\n\nThe `context` field in RunAgentInput is designed to pass contextual information to the agent, but the specific authentication context specification appears to be implemented through middleware hooks and HTTP headers rather than being rigidly defined in the RunAgentInput schema itself, allowing for flexibility across different implementations.",
